 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20charts,=20gains,=20treemap,=20logo,=20avatars?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Light/dark refinements on top of the v3.5.0 fork base.

- Chart palette: cohesive cool family (green/teal/blue) for the allocation
  gauges and bars, replacing the earthy green+sand+clay+plum mix
- Gains: --success is dark green in light mode (legible on the cream bg) and
  brighter green in dark mode; the dashboard history chart now uses --primary
  so its fill is decoupled from the gains text colour
- Treemap: bold labels without the SVG halo; light mode uses a saturated ramp so
  every tile is dark enough for uniform white labels (instead of mixed
  black/white). Magnitude still reads from the % and the depth of colour
- Sidebar logo: dropped the circular clip, drop shadow and 3D flip so the black
  mark sits flat and integrated
- Ticker avatars: neutral (bg-muted) background with foreground-coloured
  fallbacks, so coloured company logos stay distinct in both themes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
